SPECIAL ISSUE ARTICLE
What is it that you say you do here? Advocating for the critical
role of data scientists in research infrastructure
Chasz Griego 1 | Nicky Agate 1 | Ana-Maria Iosif 2 | Amy M. Crisp 3
1University Libraries, Carnegie Mellon University, Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania, USA
2Department of Public Health Sciences, University of California Davis, Davis, California, USA
3Center for Data Solutions, University of Florida College of Medicine–Jacksonville, Jacksonville, Florida, USA
